--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
humanizer draws its catalogue of AI writing tells from the English Wikipedia
page "Wikipedia:Signs of AI writing", maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup and
licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. This repository takes the taxonomy only. No text from
that page, and no text from humanizer, is reproduced here.

ASD-STE100 is a registered EU trademark (No. 017966390). The rules here are an
unofficial flavour of Simplified Technical English. This is not a certified
ASD-STE100 checker and is not affiliated with ASD.
